 según la naturaleza del caso, ya sea presentando una queja, llamando a la policía o acudiendo al tribunal laboral"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Las personas que sufren acoso laboral tienen un riesgo aproximadament…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/19-17"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["Al dejar el trabajo, pida al empleador un certificado de baja con plazo del contrato, fecha de salida, puesto y años de servicio"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Ya sea despido, fin de contrato o renuncia, el empleador debe entrega…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/es/book/19"},"children":["Leer todo el tema: Empleo, salida del empleo y accidentes de trabajo"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-ad-space life-ad-space-sponsored","data-ad-placement":"ad_footer","data-ad-group":"reading","data-ad-creative":"read_product","data-ad-ready":"false","aria-label":"Publicidad · Comunidad recomendada"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-brand"},"children":[{"tag":"img","props":{"src":"/sites/howtolivebetter/images/shengcai/logo.png","width":"565","height":"144","alt":"Logotipo oficial de Shengcai Youshu","decoding":"async"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-copy"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-label"},"children":["Publicidad · Comunidad recomendada"]},{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["¿Podría lo que sabes convertirse en un producto útil?"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"childr